From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rhnvrm <hello@rohanverma.net>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:08:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] perf: read thread archive activity without post hydration

Replace full post and thread reads with one timestamp projection over the existing primary keys. Avoid counting replies and decoding post/participant payloads when only last activity is needed. Preserve missing-root handling, database errors and the later-of-root-and-reply rule.

Builds on Karan Sharma (mr-karan) and opnlabs/mattermax#22. The original auto-archive patch and author credit remain unchanged.

Mattermax-Patch: thread-activity-lookup.patch
